OL,3,AFrench protests see numbers surge as
OL,4,Aunions join strikes over high cost of
OL,5,Aliving
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs darkness fell in Paris, Prime
OL,8,FMinister Sebastien Lecornu said he
OL,9,Fwould convene a "social conference"
OL,10,Fwith unions and employers next Monday.
OL,12,FThe wave of protests began in September
OL,13,Fover poor conditions and resources at
OL,14,Flycees (high schools), before spreading
OL,15,Fto universities, workers and a revived
OL,16,F"yellow-vest" movement against high
OL,17,Fprices.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
